%% SEITH — Lifecycle Satu Order (money-path detail)
%% Invariant Tier-0: APPROVED/SUBMITTED/FILLED wajib approved_by;
%% trader node tidak percaya status dari wire.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING_APPROVAL: Decision dari AI membuat proposal

    PENDING_APPROVAL --> APPROVED: 👤 /approve id (approved_by WAJIB)
    PENDING_APPROVAL --> REJECTED: 👤 /reject id
    PENDING_APPROVAL --> CANCELLED: /halt atau risk reject

    APPROVED --> SUBMITTED: Intake loop + RiskManager lolos
    APPROVED --> CANCELLED: RiskManager tolak atau submit gagal

    SUBMITTED --> FILLED: venue match (sandbox / live)
    SUBMITTED --> CANCELLED: cancel atau halt

    FILLED --> [*]: PnL tercatat → dashboard + notifikasi
    REJECTED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]

    note right of APPROVED
        Invariant keras di schema:
        APPROVED / SUBMITTED / FILLED
        wajib punya approved_by —
        transisi ilegal = ValidationError
    end note

    note right of SUBMITTED
        Trader node TIDAK percaya
        field status dari wire —
        verifikasi ulang ke
        catatan milik sendiri
        (seith-trading-safety)
    end note

    note left of PENDING_APPROVAL
        Kill switch aktif:
        semua submission ditolak,
        proposal terbuka dibatalkan
    end note
